，吾何以堪之。」後上使陸澄誦《孝經》，自「仲尼居」而起。儉曰：「澄所謂博而寡要，臣請誦之。」乃誦「《君子之事上》」章。上曰：「善！張子布更覺非奇也。」","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0016","person_id":"jyx_72x_8t2","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段實名及敘述視點。","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"褚淵"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0022","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段實名及敘述視點。","start":22,"end":25,"surface":"王僧虔"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0028","person_id":"408_ce3_5d8_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段實名及敘述視點。","start":28,"end":31,"surface":"沈文季"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0037","person_id":"stv_g27_gl2","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段實名及敘述視點。","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"張敬兒"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0042","person_id":"7a0_95e_c4a","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段實名及敘述視點。","start":42,"end":45,"surface":"王敬則"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0048","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段實名及敘述視點。","start":48,"end":49,"surface":"儉"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0068","person_id":"usb_lgr_ksa","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段實名及敘述視點。","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"相如"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0097","person_id":"77h_id3_a0i_AA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段實名及敘述視點。","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"陸澄"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0107","person_id":"fp6_ia6_7yw","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段實名及敘述視點。","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"仲尼"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0114","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA","kind":"person","stat